<p><span class="secnum" onclick="showFrSec('6')" title="show/hide bilingual">6(1) &nbsp; </span>The following described lands, including all government road allowances contained within the limits of the described lands, are designated as wildlife management areas, and each has the name given to it in the section heading preceding the description.</p>
	</div>
