<p><span class="secnum" onclick="showFrSec('6(78)')" title="show/hide bilingual">6(78) &nbsp; </span>In Townships&nbsp;3 and&nbsp;4, Ranges&nbsp;21 and&nbsp;22 West and being all those portions of Crown land shown on Plan No.&nbsp;19675A filed in the office of the Director of Surveys at Winnipeg.</p>
<p class="note"><a href="../annual/2002/202.pdf">M.R. 202/2002</a>; <a href="../annual/2003/165.pdf">165/2003</a>; <a href="../annual/2006/125.pdf">125/2006</a>; <a href="../annual/2008/122.pdf">122/2008</a>; <a href="../annual/2009/063.pdf">63/2009</a>; <a href="../annual/2009/064.pdf">64/2009</a>; <a href="../annual/2009/088.pdf">88/2009</a>; <a href="../annual/2009/168.pdf">168/2009</a>; <a href="../annual/2011/075.pdf">75/2011</a>; <a href="../annual/2011/128.pdf">128/2011</a>; <a href="../annual/2012/027.pdf">27/2012</a>; <a href="../annual/2015/197.pdf">197/2015</a>; <a href="../annual/2015/213.pdf">213/2015</a>; <a href="../annual/2016/150.pdf">150/2016</a>; <a href="../annual/2018/132.pdf">132/2018</a>; <a href="../annual/2021/034.pdf">34/2021</a>; <a href="../annual/2023/007.php?lang=en">7/2023</a></p>
	</div>
